      "task_number": 1,
      "prompt_html": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"../cambridge-ielts-1-13-tests/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Cambridge IELTS Tests 1 to 17</strong></a></p><p><strong><u>Task 1: </u></strong>The table below presents the number of children ever born to women aged 40-44 years in Australia for each year the information was collected since 1981.</p><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant. Write at least 150 words.</p><figure><table><thead><tr><th>Year</th><th>None %</th><th>One child %</th><th>Two children %</th><th>Three children %</th><th>Four or more children %</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>2006</td><td>15.9</td><td>13.2</td><td>38.3</td><td>21.5</td><td>11.0</td></tr><tr><td>1996</td><td>12.8</td><td>11.3</td><td>38.2</td><td>24.6</td><td>13.1</td></tr><tr><td>1986</td><td>9.7</td><td>8.7</td><td>35.6</td><td>27.0</td><td>18.9</td></tr><tr><td>1981</td><td>8.5</td><td>7.6</td><td>29.0</td><td>27.4</td><td>27.6</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br/><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins><br/></p>",
